OL,3,GNEWSAMen in court over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian nationals have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt charged with terror offences over
OL,8,Fan alleged plot to target the Jewish
OL,9,Fcommunity in Manchester.
OL,11,FRahman Salehi, 34, of Salford, and
OL,12,FSalam Ahmadyan, 36, from Liverpool,
OL,13,Fwere accused at Westminster
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court of preparing to
OL,15,Fcommit an act of terrorism or assisting
OL,16,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,17,Fon or before 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
