OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMen in court over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, who had arrived in the UK by
OL,7,Fsmall boat, were arrested in
OL,8,FManchester's Northern Quarter on the
OL,9,Feve of Yom Kippur, considered the
OL,10,Fholiest day in the Jewish calendar.
OL,12,FWearing grey tracksuits in court, they
OL,13,Fwere remanded in custody until 23
OL,14,FOctober when they will appear at the
OL,15,FOld Bailey in London.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
